NAME
    wc - count lines, words, and bytes

SYNOPSIS
    wc [-lwc] [FILE...]

DESCRIPTION
    Counts newline bytes, ASCII-whitespace-delimited words, and bytes. With no
    file, reads standard input. A FILE of - also selects standard input.

    The default output is lines, words, then bytes. Options select individual
    columns and may be combined. Multiple operands produce a total row.
